# Chroma library, modern Earth: THE ODD ONE OUT (S4, v22.3, cast_want: odd).
# The character's own ways are rare at a place (under about one in seven). No who: line; the Engine fires these at the
# place's sphere with no tie. 18 moments: 8 pairs over 8 spheres, and one place-neutral pair (no sphere:). Slot {place}.
