- U | learn their way properly, since it may teach something your own way lacks | odd: blend | v: self-direction, achievement | act: learn the place's way properly, since it may teach something their own way lacks | chance: 82
- B | keep your way, and let the numbers show it is the better one | odd: hold | v: achievement, power | act: keep their own way, and let the numbers show it is the better one | chance: 62
- R | tell them where to put the joke, and walk out to find work elsewhere | odd: leave | v: self-direction, stimulation | mark: made an enemy | chance: 80
- G | take on the ways of the house, as a new hand always has in any trade | odd: blend | v: tradition, conformity | chance: 72
- W>R | follow the house rules to the letter, and let the joke die so mornings feel easy | odd: blend | v: conformity, hedonism | chance: 66
- U>G | keep your way, and show the old hands it grew from the same old craft | odd: hold | v: tradition, self-direction | act: keep their own way, and show the old hands it grew from the same old craft | chance: 58
- B>W | bargain a good reference out of the boss, then join a place that treats newcomers fairly | odd: leave | v: power, universalism | chance: 78
- R>U | throw yourself into the house way for a month, to learn it from the inside | odd: blend | v: stimulation, self-direction | act: throw themselves into the house way for a month, to learn it from the inside | chance: 60
- G>B | keep quietly to your way, and wait for the season it proves its worth | odd: hold | v: tradition, achievement | act: keep quietly to their own way, and wait for the season it proves its worth | chance: 68
works: One day a regular tries {Ns} way on a rush job, and by the next season half of {place} works like that.
works: The joke wears out, and a quiet old hand tells {N} something about {place} that the newer ones never hear.
fails: The joke hardens into a nickname, and {N} is the last one picked for the good jobs at {place}.
fails: A rushed job goes wrong at {Ns} bench in front of everyone, and nobody lets {N} forget it.

== an old hand's quiet word to fit in
tier: everyday
stages: young_adult adult mature elder
age: 18-85
calls: WRG
rate: 1
tone: mixed
life: work, community
horizon: months
roles: regular, keeper, colleague
