- U | keep your own way, and ask the old hand what exactly rubs, and why | odd: hold | v: self-direction | act: keep their own way, and ask the old hand what exactly rubs, and why | chance: 64
- B | take the hint as a sign, and find a workplace that pays for how you work | odd: leave | v: achievement, power | act: take the hint as a sign, and find a workplace that pays for how they work | chance: 76
- R | hug the old hand, and decide on the spot to try it their way | odd: blend | v: benevolence, stimulation | mark: made a friend | chance: 70
- G | keep to the ways your family taught you, politely, and let the years do the rest | odd: hold | v: tradition | act: keep to the ways their family taught them, politely, and let the years do the rest | chance: 58
- W>G | ask the keeper, fairly, to make room at {place} for the way you were taught | odd: hold | v: universalism, tradition | act: ask the keeper, fairly, to make room at {place} for the way they were taught | chance: 62
- U>W | plan a clean exit, so the team is not split over one person's ways | odd: leave | v: benevolence, security | chance: 76
- B>U | fit in for now, and use the years to master everything {place} knows | odd: blend | v: achievement, self-direction | chance: 64
- R>B | keep your way with flair, and make it the thing people come to you for | odd: hold | v: stimulation, achievement | act: keep their own way with flair, and make it the thing people come to them for | chance: 70
- G>R | go back to work beside your own people, where your hands feel free again | odd: leave | v: tradition, hedonism | act: go back to work beside their own people, where their hands feel free again | chance: 82
works: The old hand becomes {Ns} quiet ally at {place}, and the grumbling stops.
works: A year on, the boss asks {N} to show the others the very trick everyone had laughed at.
fails: Word gets round that {N} was spoken to, and the regulars at {place} grow cooler for it.
