scene: A year on at {place}, {N} still does things a little differently: stands when others sit, speaks when others keep quiet, keeps a small habit of their own through the prayers. Over tea after the service, one of the regulars draws {N} aside, kindly enough. People have noticed, she says, and newcomers who settle in tend to follow the way things are done here. She means it as help.
